Drafting the analysis — this calls the local Claude Code CLI and takes a minute.
  Read and correct <demo>/specs/dev/demo1/001-say-hello-on-the-front-page/02-analysis.md — it is the input to the contract.
The gate "the story is still the empty template" (core/scripts/functions/fun-spdd.sh, spdd_analysis) did not hold: an
analysis was drafted from a story nobody wrote. The items therefore say that holding this gate is the reader's job.
